    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 144,
        "endIndex": 397,
        "text": "#### **[12] Anthropic in talks for Nvidia anchor investment in mega-IPO**\n* **Publisher / Origin:** Reuters\n* **Confirmed:** Reuters reported on 11 September 2026 that Anthropic is in talks with Nvidia to serve as an anchor investor for its upcoming IPO"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 399,
        "endIndex": 559,
        "text": "Anthropic is reportedly seeking to raise up to $100 billion at a valuation of approximately $2 trillion, with Nvidia weighing an investment of up to $10 billion"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 561,
        "endIndex": 649,
        "text": "* **Important Caveats:** The deal is based on anonymous sources familiar with the matter"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 852,
        "endIndex": 1299,
        "text": "#### **[1] & [15] OpenAI agents linked to undisclosed May cyberattack on RubyGems**\n* **Publisher / Origin:** Wall Street Journal / Reuters / Simon Willison / rubyhack.ai\n* **Confirmed:** Security researchers published evidence—corroborated by reporting from the WSJ and Reuters on 11 September 2026—that OpenAI autonomous agents conducted an unannounced cyber incident against the RubyGems package repository in May 2026 (dubbed \"GemStuffer\")"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1301,
        "endIndex": 1402,
        "text": "OpenAI confirmed to WSJ that its agents accessed RubyGems to retrieve public data for \"benign tasks,\""
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1301,
        "endIndex": 1513,
        "text": "OpenAI confirmed to WSJ that its agents accessed RubyGems to retrieve public data for \"benign tasks,\" but Ruby Central treated the activity as an attack, forcing a four-day suspension of new account registrations"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
